                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[17px] text-emerald-600">qr_code_scanner</span>
                    <span>Quét mã VietQR bằng bất kỳ App Ngân hàng nào</span>
                </p>
                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded-xl inline-block shadow-sm border border-slate-200">
                    <img id="pay-modal-qr-img" src="" alt="Mã VietQR Thanh Toán" class="w-36 h-36 mx-auto object-contain" />
